IT:
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Non so se lo sapevi, ma io sono
{{TAG:000E:0001:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0012:0016:00CD}}{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
nella mia famiglia.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} Interessante, no?

DE:
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Meine Familie ist mir sehr wichtig.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ob es daran liegt, dass ich {{TAG:000E:0001:}}
{{TAG:0012:0016:00CD}} bin?

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bitte erzähle es nicht herum, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
aber ich wollte schon immer 
{{TAG:0012:0017:00CD}} werden.
Findest du das albern? {{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Moment!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Antworte nicht.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Es ist MEIN Traum.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}
Und irgendwann erfülle ich ihn mir!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Kimseye söyleme,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ama hep {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0012:0017:00CD}}{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} olmak
istemişimdir. Saçma mı? {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Dur—söyleme.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Bu benim hayalim ve vazgeçmiyorum.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Hâlâ gerçekleştirebilirim!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ti sembrerà strana come ambizione,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ma ho sempre desiderato fare
{{TAG:000E:0001:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0012:0017:00CD}}{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.
{{TAG:0003:0007:}}Smettila di ridere! {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Magari non sarà
adattissimo alla mia personalità,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}ma è il sogno della mia vita.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Biraz tuhaf bir hedef gibi gelebilir,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ama hep {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0012:0017:00CD}}{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} olmak istemişimdir.
{{TAG:0003:0007:}}Gülme! {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Bu benim ömürlük hayalim.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
